// ---------- the dress form itself: one smooth plaster body ----------
// A signed distance field: the torso from the profile above, two arm stubs
// and the neck, each cut flat the way a dress form is, joined by smooth
// unions so there are no seams. It is turned into a mesh with surface nets,
// in short slices so the page keeps moving while it builds. Normals come from
